  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Slice mini flour tortillas into quarters.\n• Divide between two lined oven trays (don’t worry if they overlap).\n• Turn with olive oil and season with salt. Bake until lightly golden and crispy, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639ba7f6caa202cc54071065/step-7e0e63cf.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop tomato. Finely chop or crush garlic. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse chickpeas. Drain sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn (covering with lid) until lightly browned, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a medium bowl and set aside.\n• Meanwhile, combine garlic and a drizzle of olive oil in a small heatproof bowl.\n• Microwave in 10 second bursts until fragrant. Stir in yoghurt until combined. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639ba7f6caa202cc54071065/step-887bdd1c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add chickpeas, carrot, tomato paste and spicy taco seasoning (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and cook, stirring, until softened and fragrant, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in the water, butter, brown sugar and vegetable stock powder, and cook until combined and slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639ba7f6caa202cc54071065/step-0f4790dc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, add tomato, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil to bowl with corn.\n• Toss to combine and season.\n• Divide tortilla chips between bowls. Top with chickpeas, charred corn salsa and garlic yoghurt.\n• Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639ba7f6caa202cc54071065/step-f9e7cdcf.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
